    "media:imagetext": "TWA\nBest bill of fare in the air\nGo ahead, feast your eyes... and wish you were on a TWA Skyliner!\nFood like this makes dining with TWA a different, delightful\ninterlude and one of the high spots of your Constellation flight. It's\nfun being TWA's guest because there's no standing in line, no tipping\nand no check. You stay right in your comfortable seat, and\na whole wonderful meal like this is brought to you with\nWhere in the world do you want to go? For information\nand reservations, call TWA or see your travel agent.\nTWA's compliments, on all regular-fare flights at mealtime.\nFly the fines.. FLY IWA\nNEWFOUNDLAND\nSHANNON\nLONDON\nFRANKFURT\nTRANS WORLD AIRLINES\nPARIS\nZURICH\nU.S. A. • EUROPE • AFRICA • ASIA\nGENEVA\nMILAN\nSAN FRANCISCO\nDETROIT\nCHICAGO\nKANSAS PITTSBURGH\n- CITY S\nST. LOUIS\nBOSTON.\nNEW YORK\nPHILADELPHIA\nBALTIMORE\nWASHINGTON\nROME\nAZORES\nLOS ANGELES\nPHOEN SUQUERQUE\nMADRID\nLISBON\nATHENS\nTUNIS\nTEL-AVIV\nBOMBAY\nALGIERS\nTRIPOLI\nBENGASI CAIRO\nBASRA\nCOLOMBOS",
